WEBVTT

00:04.580 --> 00:06.830
<b>Tsukishima, Chuo Ward, Tokyo.</b>

00:07.750 --> 00:12.380
<b>Spanning more than 400 years
since the Edo Period, is Takamimi Shrine.</b>

00:14.960 --> 00:18.250
<b>So these are the famous blue waters of Okinawa...</b>

00:19.080 --> 00:20.790
<b>It's so soothing.</b>

00:22.210 --> 00:27.130
<b>Oh, we can get to Kokusaidori Street from here, huh...?</b>

00:28.170 --> 00:32.710
<b>Is that Blue Sale ice cream? Looks delicious.</b>

00:33.380 --> 00:35.460
<b>What flavor do you want, Koito?</b>

00:36.460 --> 00:40.210
<b>Since we went through all the trouble
of coming to Okinawa... I'll have passion fruit sorbet.</b>

00:40.750 --> 00:43.790
<b>Then maybe I'll have purple yam ice cream!</b>

00:44.170 --> 00:46.580
<b>This pretend travel game
is really bumming me out, let's stop.</b>

00:47.830 --> 00:54.380
<b>The goddess summoned from another world
enshrined here was an absolute social recluse of an elf.</b>

00:55.210 --> 00:58.250
<b>And I told you, now isn't the time for it!</b>

00:58.580 --> 01:00.420
<b>Oh no, it's already 2:00!</b>

01:00.790 --> 01:03.540
<b>Huh? Did we have something to do today?</b>

01:03.790 --> 01:06.040
<b>We have guests coming from Osaka.</b>

01:06.380 --> 01:10.830
<b>Grandpa has some urgent business
to take care of so he's out, and I have to handle it.</b>

01:12.170 --> 01:15.830
<b>Koyuzu isn't here either, so I'm counting on you
to hold down the fort, Elda.</b>

01:19.000 --> 01:22.290
<b>O-Osaka? She can't mean...</b>

02:54.170 --> 02:58.790
<b>EPISODE 4</b>

02:54.170 --> 02:58.790
<b>THE ELF BATTLE</b>

02:54.170 --> 02:58.790
<b>OF ALL TIMES AND PLACES</b>

03:00.130 --> 03:01.710
<b>And that should do it.</b>

03:02.210 --> 03:06.170
<b>Since they're Grandpa's guests,
I gotta make sure I don't do anything rude.</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:13.040
<b>Is that kid lost?</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:17.460
<b>What's wrong? Did you lose your mom?</b>

03:23.330 --> 03:25.130
<b>Those ears are long...</b>

03:25.960 --> 03:29.960
<b>Wh-what...? Wh-when did this happen?</b>

03:30.080 --> 03:32.670
<b>Himawari disappeared!</b>

03:33.000 --> 03:37.380
<b>A-and this street smells like some real tasty sauce!</b>

03:37.630 --> 03:40.580
<b>Now I'm feelin' a bit homesick.</b>

03:41.540 --> 03:45.000
<b>Yeah, no doubt about it, she's connected to Elda.</b>

03:45.830 --> 03:47.040
<b>So that must mean...</b>

03:48.080 --> 03:52.670
<b>U-um, excuse me, I'm with the Takamimi Shrine.</b>

03:53.210 --> 03:55.290
<b>Huh? For real?</b>

03:55.750 --> 03:58.710
<b>TAKAMIMI SHRINE</b>

04:00.040 --> 04:02.540
<b>We're having guests from Osaka...</b>

04:03.380 --> 04:04.420
<b>I'm curious...</b>

04:05.250 --> 04:07.710
<b>Could it be them?</b>

04:09.380 --> 04:11.250
<b>P-pardon me!</b>

04:12.500 --> 04:14.170
<b>That intonation she just used...</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:17.880
<b>That sounds like someone saying
"Excuse me" from the Kansai region!</b>

04:18.830 --> 04:21.790
<b>I knew it was you, Hiromimi Hime-no-Mikoto!</b>

04:21.920 --> 04:23.380
<b>I mean, Yol...</b>

04:27.130 --> 04:27.580
<b>...de.</b>

04:33.210 --> 04:34.000
<b>Who is that?</b>

04:37.920 --> 04:39.580
<b>Himawari!</b>

04:39.580 --> 04:41.710
<b>Why the dickens did ya disappear?!</b>

04:41.710 --> 04:43.460
<b>You're the one who disappeared!</b>

04:43.830 --> 04:47.250
<b>Ain't I always telling you not to walk around
on your own or you'll get lost?!</b>

04:47.420 --> 04:48.920
<b>You got a awful sense of direction!</b>

04:48.920 --> 04:50.920
<b>That ain't true!</b>

04:50.920 --> 04:52.250
<b>What part ain't true?</b>

04:53.380 --> 04:56.540
<b>I-in any case, I'm glad we found each other.</b>

04:57.460 --> 04:59.500
<b>My goddess caused quite the fuss.</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:03.420
<b>Hiromimi Hime-no-Mikoto</b>

04:59.500 --> 05:03.420
<b>Real Name: Yoldeleela Leela Fenomenea (Age 622)</b>

05:00.210 --> 05:03.830
<b>This is Hiromimi Shrine's Hiromimi Hime-no-Mikoto.</b>

05:05.580 --> 05:09.210
<b>I am her miko, Himawari Kohinata.</b>

05:06.830 --> 05:10.000
<b>Hiromimi Shrine - 15th Miko</b>

05:06.830 --> 05:10.000
<b>Himawari Kohinata (Age 16)</b>

05:10.290 --> 05:15.290
<b>It's nice to meet you.
I'm Takamimi Shrine's miko, Koito Koganei.</b>

05:15.420 --> 05:19.330
<b>Koito's a real nice girl, Himawari! She let me eat gelato!</b>

05:20.040 --> 05:22.000
<b>Because you wouldn't stop crying, you know.</b>

05:22.750 --> 05:25.630
<b>You wouldn't stop crying, eh? Thanks for that.</b>

05:26.130 --> 05:28.790
<b>Oh, so you're allowed to say things like that.</b>

05:29.080 --> 05:32.830
<b>S-so you are our guest, Yolde...</b>

05:33.540 --> 05:36.960
<b>You sure are active for someone
who has always had an awful sense of direction?</b>

05:37.330 --> 05:38.500
<b>Stop hiding behind me.</b>

05:39.000 --> 05:44.130
<b>It's been a good 200 years, eh, Elda? And it looks like
you're still the same shut-in you've always been!</b>

05:44.540 --> 05:45.750
<b>Lemme go already.</b>

05:46.080 --> 05:49.250
<b>Say, what kind of relationship
do you have with Yolde-sama?</b>

05:49.750 --> 05:53.380
<b>Sh-she's an elf who was summoned here
at the same time as I was.</b>

05:53.750 --> 05:58.960
<b>I was summoned by Ieyasu Tokugawa,
and Yolde is here due to Hideyoshi Toyotomi.</b>

05:59.830 --> 06:12.500
<b>EAST</b>

05:59.830 --> 06:12.500
<b>WEST</b>

06:02.420 --> 06:04.420
<b>So it's like you two are from rival factions?</b>

06:04.880 --> 06:11.960
<b>I-it's a little more complicated than that, but I suppose.
Yolde is always picking on me about something.</b>

06:12.630 --> 06:19.040
<b>Hey Elda! I get to take the bullet trains!
Have you ever taken one before? Huh? Huh?!</b>

06:19.710 --> 06:21.830
<b>She's always saying things like this.</b>

06:22.080 --> 06:23.170
<b>It's a pain in the neck!</b>

06:24.790 --> 06:28.080
<b>However... Could Yolde possibly... ?</b>

06:31.920 --> 06:39.080
<b>The reason you came out here in person is because
you want to settle the Ringberry Bjorling ?</b>

06:40.040 --> 06:41.250
<b>That's right.</b>

06:42.040 --> 06:46.460
<b>The ultimate head to head battle passed down
through the Elf tribe, Ringberry Bjorling!</b>

06:47.250 --> 06:52.500
<b>The time has finally come to determine
the winner of our 400-plus year battle...</b>

06:53.000 --> 06:56.250
<b>of Ringberry Bjorling!</b>

07:03.040 --> 07:08.670
<b>I didn't realize Elda was this devoted
to the competition of Lingberry... no Ringbelly...</b>

07:08.670 --> 07:11.960
<b>Er, Lean... be.... What was it again?!</b>

07:10.380 --> 07:12.130
<b>Ringberry Bjorling</b>

07:41.130 --> 07:45.500
<b>It's a draw, huh? Then altogether this is the 399th go...</b>

07:46.960 --> 07:48.960
<b>We still can't end this!</b>

07:49.540 --> 07:52.330
<b>Hold on, that's just a game of Tic-tac-toe!</b>

07:52.330 --> 07:57.080
<b>Correct. The name's impressive,
but it's essentially x's and o's.</b>

07:53.330 --> 07:54.960
<b>Ringberry Bjorling</b>

07:58.290 --> 08:03.170
<b>Just as suspected, I couldn't completey
demolish your iron wall of protection.</b>

08:04.710 --> 08:07.540
<b>I'm having a hard time
withstanding your surge of attacks.</b>

08:08.330 --> 08:11.580
<b>Uh, this has nothing to do with attacks
or protection or anything like that.</b>

08:11.580 --> 08:16.580
<b>If neither of you make a mistake,
then your game of Tic-tac-toe will always end in a tie.</b>

08:18.380 --> 08:19.130
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:19.250 --> 08:22.580
<b>What? You didn't know that?! Sorry!</b>

08:25.460 --> 08:28.670
<b>A-and you, Himawari?! Didja know this?!</b>

08:32.500 --> 08:33.540
<b>Hadn't the slightest idea.</b>

08:34.960 --> 08:38.500
<b>Didn't think so! You woulda told me if ya did know!</b>

08:38.500 --> 08:39.460
<b>'Course I would.</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:40.960
<b>She totally knew.</b>

08:43.080 --> 08:49.170
<b>Listen, Yolde. Your game of Tic-tac-toe
with Elda-sama is no longer a matter of winning or losing.</b>

08:49.420 --> 08:50.080
<b>Oh?</b>

08:50.750 --> 08:54.420
<b>When you look back on all the time
locked in a fierce contest...</b>

08:55.420 --> 09:01.580
<b>Ta-da! T...Tic-tac-toe becomes a rut
in the form of the friendship between you two!</b>

09:05.710 --> 09:08.790
<b>Impressive as always, Himawari! Wonderful point!</b>

09:08.880 --> 09:11.380
<b>Yeah, a friendship nut!</b>

09:13.500 --> 09:16.630
<b>In any case, Yolde-sama is adorable.</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:21.040
<b>Her miko Kohinata uses the strong style approach
when diverting a conversation.</b>

09:21.750 --> 09:23.130
<b>She stumbled, but she was assertive.</b>

09:25.540 --> 09:28.420
<b>I didn't know elves also go on trips and stuff.</b>

09:29.040 --> 09:31.670
<b>I've grown accustomed
to Elda's reclusive nature, though.</b>

09:32.880 --> 09:37.000
<b>I love traveling! Been a good minute
since I've been to Tokyo, though!</b>

09:37.380 --> 09:41.960
<b>Yolde is the type that just can't sit still
so we're constantly going here and there.</b>

09:42.290 --> 09:46.460
<b>Oh, right. We forgot to give you our souvenirs.</b>

09:47.670 --> 09:50.170
<b>Please enjoy this with everyone here.</b>

09:50.500 --> 09:52.500
<b>Wow, thanks!</b>

09:52.500 --> 09:56.960
<b>P-p-p-p-pork buns from 551!
I've been wanting to try these!</b>

09:57.130 --> 10:00.880
<b>Me, too! This pork bun shop is only in the Kansai region!</b>

10:01.380 --> 10:03.380
<b>Over there, we call these "hog rolls."</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:08.250
<b>Did you know, Koito?! We call this stuff
from the Kansai area "kudarimono"!</b>

10:08.420 --> 10:11.210
<b>Oh, really? Kudarimono, huh?</b>

10:11.420 --> 10:16.790
<b>K-Kyoto was the center of culture,
and Osaka was called the Kitchen of the Nation.</b>

10:17.420 --> 10:19.210
<b>Basically, in the Kyoto-Osaka area,</b>

10:19.210 --> 10:23.750
<b>there were several towns of great tradesman
who used their skills in the imperial court.</b>

10:23.790 --> 10:30.540
<b>KUDARI-ALCOHOL</b>

10:23.790 --> 10:30.540
<b>KUDARI-CANDY</b>

10:23.790 --> 10:30.540
<b>KUDARI-RICE</b>

10:24.040 --> 10:27.040
<b>That's why the things of nice quality
that originated in Kyoto and Osaka</b>

10:27.040 --> 10:30.290
<b>spreading through Edo and Japan
are called "kudarimono."</b>

10:30.960 --> 10:35.710
<b>However, Yolde, these are not
"kudarimono," they're "meibutsu."</b>

10:36.000 --> 10:36.750
<b>Huh?</b>

10:37.040 --> 10:39.380
<b>"Kudarimono" is a formal way of putting it,</b>

10:39.380 --> 10:42.630
<b>and that term has caught on for things
even outside of the Kyoto-Osaka area.</b>

10:42.830 --> 10:46.130
<b>The 551 shop is exclusive to the
Kyoto-Osaka area, or a local specialty.</b>

10:45.080 --> 10:46.130
<b>Meibutsu</b>

10:47.210 --> 10:51.330
<b>By the way, things that are sent to
the Kyoto-Osaka area from Edo are "nobosemono,"</b>

10:51.540 --> 10:55.290
<b>and things from the surrounding area
of Edo were called "jimawarimono..."</b>

10:57.250 --> 10:58.080
<b>What?!</b>

11:00.330 --> 11:05.880
<b>Th-these aren't "kudarimono"? I-I made a mistake?</b>

11:09.670 --> 11:15.290
<b>Elda's smarter than me!
Even though I'd be the big sister here!</b>

11:15.290 --> 11:18.670
<b>I gotta be the awesome one!</b>

11:18.330 --> 11:19.500
<b>Yolde Age 622</b>

11:21.080 --> 11:23.830
<b>What?! Yolde-sama is the older of you two?</b>

11:24.130 --> 11:25.290
<b>Just by a year.</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:25.540
<b>Elda Age 621</b>

11:25.830 --> 11:29.170
<b>That's why she makes a point
to be better than me at everything.</b>

11:29.670 --> 11:35.920
<b>Ah! This means you've won, don't it?!
It's zero wins, one loss, and 399 draws!</b>

11:35.920 --> 11:38.670
<b>I-I lost!</b>

11:38.670 --> 11:41.920
<b>Y..Yolde-sama, let's have some snacks, okay?</b>

11:44.630 --> 11:46.880
<b>U-um, Yolde...</b>

11:48.250 --> 11:55.330
<b>Y-you came to see me out of the blue today
and that was such a surprise,</b>

11:56.000 --> 12:00.790
<b>and perhaps that's why I beat you... so, um...</b>

12:01.540 --> 12:05.920
<b>now I've also had one loss and it's another draw.</b>

12:09.420 --> 12:10.630
<b>You're right...</b>

12:11.960 --> 12:13.170
<b>You're right!</b>

12:14.080 --> 12:15.920
<b>Good for you, Yolde.</b>

12:15.920 --> 12:16.750
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:19.210 --> 12:23.630
<b>I like that part of you, Elda.
You're kind of acting like an older sister today.</b>

12:24.630 --> 12:28.460
<b>Well, anyways, I just made a pit stop
to come see ya, Elda.</b>

12:29.630 --> 12:30.330
<b>What?</b>

12:33.170 --> 12:35.130
<b>I WILL ALWAYS</b>

12:33.170 --> 12:35.130
<b>SUPPORT YOU</b>

12:35.130 --> 12:40.080
<b>I WILL ALWAYS</b>

12:35.130 --> 12:40.080
<b>SUPPORT YOU</b>

12:35.130 --> 12:40.080
<b>LOOK AT ME</b>

12:36.330 --> 12:39.540
<b>We're headed to Tokyo Dome to see my fave in concert!</b>

12:40.290 --> 12:41.500
<b>Welp, see ya!</b>

12:41.500 --> 12:42.710
<b>Thanks for havin' us!</b>

12:43.580 --> 12:46.500
<b>Himawari! If we don't get movin' we'll miss out on merch!</b>

12:46.500 --> 12:48.710
<b>You're right! Let's get going, Yolde!</b>

12:50.750 --> 12:54.920
<b>Y-you understand why that elf annoys me, yes?</b>

12:55.210 --> 12:56.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:56.500 --> 13:00.500
<b>Grandpa ran off somewhere
because he didn't want to see Yolde-sama, huh?</b>

13:02.290 --> 13:08.130
<b>But... I guess I'm happy to see Elda
acting a bit differently than usual.</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:11.290
<b>What's wrong?</b>

13:11.710 --> 13:14.210
<b>Oh, it's nothing.</b>

13:15.250 --> 13:17.710
<b>TAKAMIMI SHRINE</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:20.080
<b>Later, I exchanged email addresses with Himawari.</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:35.670
<b>Koito-chan, thanks so much</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:35.670
<b>for your hospitality yesterday!</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:35.670
<b>I had tons of fun and I'm mighty glad I met ya.</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:35.670
<b>Us miko should stick together.</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:35.670
<b>Let's have some sweets next time.</b>

13:25.790 --> 13:30.750
<b>"Koito-chan, thanks so much for your hospitality
yesterday! I had tons of fun and I'm mighty glad I met ya.</b>

13:30.920 --> 13:34.670
<b>Us miko should stick together.
Let's have some sweets next time."</b>

13:36.380 --> 13:38.630
<b>Hima-chan, this message just doesn't sound like you.</b>

13:45.170 --> 13:47.630
<b>We truly appreciate your visit today.</b>

13:48.330 --> 13:50.000
<b>Please be careful on your way home.</b>

13:51.210 --> 13:54.830
<b>Thanks, Koito-chan. Give my regards to Takamimi-sama!</b>

13:55.710 --> 14:00.000
<b>Seeing Takamimi-sama has given me
peace of mind for this child, too.</b>

14:04.250 --> 14:05.750
<b>All done for today, Elda.</b>

14:07.130 --> 14:09.580
<b>We're due for a break, so do you want to have some tea?</b>

14:09.880 --> 14:17.920
<b>Y-yeah. T-today I met three babies
doing their first shrine visit and I'm exhausted.</b>

14:18.420 --> 14:22.580
<b>Even afraid of meeting babies, huh? You're committed.</b>

14:23.080 --> 14:26.210
<b>Oh, I'll be out with Koma-chan this afternoon.</b>

14:26.210 --> 14:28.080
<b>Eh? Hoi!</b>

14:28.540 --> 14:28.960
<b>Huh?</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:30.500
<b>What?</b>

14:30.500 --> 14:32.670
<b>Th-the thing you just did...</b>

14:33.130 --> 14:36.790
<b>Eh-eh-eh... hoi!</b>

14:38.330 --> 14:41.130
<b>I-I may have a slight cold.</b>

14:42.210 --> 14:45.290
<b>Uh, that was a sneeze?</b>

14:45.920 --> 14:47.750
<b>Ehhh-hoi!</b>

14:48.290 --> 14:50.750
<b>Cold pack</b>

14:48.290 --> 14:50.750
<b>Fever refresh</b>

14:48.420 --> 14:50.330
<b>Ehhh-hoi!</b>

14:51.380 --> 14:52.830
<b>It's a simple cold.</b>

14:53.210 --> 14:55.420
<b>If you take your medicine and rest, it'll clear up.</b>

14:55.830 --> 14:59.920
<b>Wh-where's Kaoru? I'd like to have her see me.</b>

15:00.250 --> 15:04.080
<b>My mom's already retired.
Sasaki Clinic was handed down to me.</b>

15:04.080 --> 15:07.880
<b>C-call her. I want Kaoru!</b>

15:08.080 --> 15:10.670
<b>I don't like you, Akane! You're scary!</b>

15:10.790 --> 15:13.580
<b>I'll be doing your periodic check ups
from here on as well.</b>

15:13.790 --> 15:17.540
<b>No! I don't want that! Hoi!</b>

15:18.000 --> 15:23.750
<b>I'm glad it's not anything serious, but I wonder
if you gave it to the babies that came for a shrine visit.</b>

15:24.170 --> 15:28.170
<b>Don't worry about that. Humans can't catch elf colds.</b>

15:28.670 --> 15:31.790
<b>Huh? Really? Then this cold means...</b>

15:35.420 --> 15:37.460
<b>Yolde-sama is sick in bed, too.</b>

15:37.790 --> 15:43.000
<b>That's... that's what I was thinking.
Yolde must have brought it here with her.</b>

15:43.210 --> 15:46.000
<b>Okay, Takamimi-sama, stick your arm out real quick.</b>

15:46.000 --> 15:46.670
<b>Huh?</b>

15:51.000 --> 15:54.170
<b>I-I DON'T WANT A SHOT! I HATE GETTING SHOTS!</b>

15:54.540 --> 15:58.130
<b>No, no, no!</b>

15:55.250 --> 15:56.580
<b>Koito, help me out!</b>

15:57.040 --> 15:58.130
<b>Jeez.</b>

15:58.290 --> 16:01.210
<b>Stop it! I-I'm a supreme being, you know!</b>

16:01.210 --> 16:04.460
<b>If you do this, I-I will bring
divine retribution down upon you!</b>

16:04.460 --> 16:08.580
<b>Takamimi-sama, you have no divine powers, right?
How will you bring this divine retribution?</b>

16:08.920 --> 16:12.130
<b>I will write mean things
about your hospital on the internet!</b>

16:12.580 --> 16:14.080
<b>Penal Code Article 233</b>

16:12.580 --> 16:14.080
<b>Defamation</b>

16:12.590 --> 16:14.080
<b>and Obstruction</b>

16:12.590 --> 16:14.080
<b>of Business</b>

16:14.210 --> 16:15.290
<b>Shut up!</b>

16:20.380 --> 16:23.000
<b>Akane-chan has gotten so cool.</b>

16:23.000 --> 16:26.330
<b>She's working so hard at her job like a grown woman!</b>

16:26.750 --> 16:32.040
<b>She's always been a prodigy,
but her whole vibe changes when she wears contacts.</b>

16:32.750 --> 16:36.170
<b>And she was so cute as a baby, too...</b>

16:36.170 --> 16:38.040
<b>What a rude thing to say.</b>

16:38.500 --> 16:41.830
<b>Have you been going to appointments
at Sasaki Clinic for a long time now?</b>

16:42.290 --> 16:47.170
<b>Y-yeah, I've been their patient since the Edo period.</b>

16:47.790 --> 16:53.710
<b>The class system in the Edo period was very strict
and you couldn't freely choose your occupation,</b>

16:54.000 --> 16:57.750
<b>however, a doctor was the only thing
anyone was allowed to become.</b>

16:57.750 --> 17:01.500
<b>Eh, really? Were medical licenses not a thing back then?</b>

17:01.710 --> 17:06.250
<b>No. If you said "I'm a doctor starting today,"
then you had become a doctor.</b>

17:03.540 --> 17:12.670
<b>Doctor</b>

17:06.330 --> 17:08.330
<b>Bad doctors were plentiful, though.</b>

17:07.540 --> 17:12.670
<b>Doctor</b>

17:08.330 --> 17:12.670
<b>If you got treatment from a bad doctor,
not even curable illnesses would get better.</b>

17:10.960 --> 17:12.670
<b>Doctor</b>

17:12.960 --> 17:21.210
<b>I've encountered them so many times, I ended up
not seeing a doctor until I went to the Sasaki Clinic.</b>

17:21.540 --> 17:23.830
<b>Then what did you do when you were sick?</b>

17:24.420 --> 17:27.380
<b>I went to the shrine one town over to pray to the gods.</b>

17:25.750 --> 17:30.040
<b>WILL THEY</b>

17:25.750 --> 17:30.040
<b> FIND OUT?</b>

17:26.210 --> 17:33.960
<b> THEY WON'T,</b>

17:26.210 --> 17:33.960
<b>RIGHT?</b>

17:27.880 --> 17:29.920
<b>A god doesn't pray to gods.</b>

17:30.330 --> 17:33.710
<b>Yeah, the miko at that time was also quite angry...</b>

17:36.630 --> 17:41.540
<b>Well, rest up and get some sleep.
I'll be straightening up the front.</b>

17:41.790 --> 17:43.250
<b>Call me if you need anything.</b>

17:43.460 --> 17:44.630
<b>O-okay.</b>

17:52.330 --> 17:54.500
<b>Miko, oh miko...</b>

17:54.750 --> 17:57.710
<b>Spirit magic? Did she lose her voice?</b>

18:00.710 --> 18:01.750
<b>What's up?</b>

18:01.920 --> 18:04.130
<b>I-I'm thirsty...</b>

18:04.540 --> 18:07.380
<b>Okay. Can you drink the water yourself?</b>

18:07.540 --> 18:09.290
<b>I-I don't think so.</b>

18:09.290 --> 18:10.750
<b>Guess I'll help then.</b>

18:14.130 --> 18:15.880
<b>Just take your time.</b>

18:17.880 --> 18:19.920
<b>Koito is so kind.</b>

18:22.670 --> 18:25.080
<b>Now, I'm going to straighten up the front.</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:26.380
<b>O-okay.</b>

18:31.920 --> 18:33.710
<b>Miko, oh miko...</b>

18:38.830 --> 18:39.920
<b>What's wrong?</b>

18:39.920 --> 18:42.080
<b>M-my feet are cold.</b>

18:42.500 --> 18:44.670
<b>I'll get you the heating pad then.</b>

18:44.670 --> 18:45.920
<b>'K-'kay.</b>

18:49.580 --> 18:51.080
<b>So warm...</b>

18:53.630 --> 18:55.670
<b>Great. Okay, I'm...</b>

18:55.670 --> 18:57.710
<b>Miko, oh miko...</b>

18:59.750 --> 19:02.250
<b>S-scratch my back.</b>

19:09.420 --> 19:11.380
<b>Miko, oh miko...</b>

19:11.670 --> 19:16.670
<b>Okay, I get it! You're lonely, aren't you?
I'm here now, so quit it!</b>

19:20.460 --> 19:23.420
<b>Hiromimi Shrine</b>

19:23.920 --> 19:28.080
<b>I reckon you're the one who passed
that cold onto Elda-sama.</b>

19:28.330 --> 19:32.460
<b>R-Really? Elda's got a fever, too?</b>

19:32.460 --> 19:34.170
<b>It's right around 102 degrees.</b>

19:34.380 --> 19:38.670
<b>M-mine's at 104.36! I win!</b>

19:38.670 --> 19:40.830
<b>I think that might actually be losing.</b>

19:41.330 --> 19:43.790
<b>TAKAMIMI SHRINE</b>

19:48.040 --> 19:49.630
<b>She's finally asleep.</b>

19:50.380 --> 19:52.960
<b>I really pampered Elda today.</b>

19:53.670 --> 19:58.000
<b>I wonder, did mom also overindulge me
when I had a cold?</b>

20:00.130 --> 20:04.670
<b>She was a little kinder than usual,
she'd make me warm rice porridge,</b>

20:04.880 --> 20:07.670
<b>and I was happy, even though I was sick.</b>

20:08.460 --> 20:12.500
<b>I know! I'll make Elda some yummy rice porridge, too!</b>

20:12.960 --> 20:14.580
<b>I've never made it before, though!</b>

20:13.670 --> 20:15.540
<b>The reckless confidence of an amateur</b>

20:17.630 --> 20:18.960
<b>Sensing Anxiety</b>

20:23.170 --> 20:25.790
<b>Rice porridge... rice porridge...</b>

20:26.420 --> 20:28.040
<b>How do I make that, again?</b>

20:28.380 --> 20:32.460
<b>What? Are you making a late-night snack, Sis?
Want me to do it for you?</b>

20:32.670 --> 20:36.420
<b>Nah, it's fine. I want to try to make it myself.</b>

20:37.000 --> 20:40.290
<b>Can I use the dish soap when I'm washing the rice?</b>

20:40.580 --> 20:43.380
<b>Just wash it with water, not soap.</b>

20:43.540 --> 20:45.540
<b>Oh, gotcha. Thanks!</b>

20:46.580 --> 20:48.920
<b>Can I share the kitchen with you?</b>

20:48.920 --> 20:52.500
<b>Yeah. Let's see, the other ingredients are...</b>

20:53.580 --> 20:56.460
<b>I don't see you cooking very often, Sis.</b>

20:56.580 --> 21:00.080
<b>Yeah, I just wanted to try to make some rice porridge.</b>

21:00.250 --> 21:01.830
<b>Oh, do we have green onion?</b>

21:02.080 --> 21:03.290
<b>Yup, we do.</b>

21:24.040 --> 21:31.580
<b>Hmm, I feel like it lacks some punch.
Soy sauce? Other sauce? No... sugar?</b>

21:32.130 --> 21:36.830
<b>Oh, actually, I once heard that spicy is good
when you have no appetite.</b>

21:37.170 --> 21:38.750
<b>All right, curry powder.</b>

21:40.080 --> 21:41.170
<b>It's done!</b>

21:42.130 --> 21:44.830
<b>It ended up kind of like a curry, though!</b>

21:49.170 --> 21:50.290
<b>Elda.</b>

21:52.250 --> 21:55.630
<b>Do you have an appetite?
I made some rice porridge for you.</b>

21:58.170 --> 22:05.460
<b>Oh, Koito. Elda said she wanted something hearty, so I
made her a rice cutlet bowl. Would you like some, too?</b>

22:07.330 --> 22:08.420
<b>Yes, please.</b>

22:08.670 --> 22:12.210
<b>Okay, I'll go make you one! Enjoy your meal, Elda-sama!</b>

22:15.380 --> 22:17.960
<b>Is that curry? Smells good.</b>

22:18.080 --> 22:20.130
<b>It's porr... It's curry.</b>

22:20.460 --> 22:22.790
<b>If you pour it on the rice cutlet bowl,
it makes a curry rice cutlet bowl!</b>

22:22.790 --> 22:24.170
<b>Pour it on, pour it on!</b>

22:24.420 --> 22:28.080
<b>Wh-what's most important is that you like it.</b>

22:32.960 --> 22:39.580
<b>Himawari! I wanna eat some skewered meat!
Something with tons of sauce on it!</b>

22:39.580 --> 22:43.170
<b>Okay, hold your horses. I'm ordering us some Uher Eats.</b>

22:45.830 --> 22:48.290
<b>I made rice porridge for Elda but I</b>

22:45.830 --> 22:48.290
<b>put curry in it for some reason...</b>

22:45.840 --> 22:48.290
<b>But she said putting the curry</b>

22:45.840 --> 22:48.290
<b>on her cutlet bowl would  make it curry rice cutlet bowl</b>

22:45.840 --> 22:48.290
<b>and she's gobbling it down. I'm glad she's eating it!</b>

22:48.580 --> 22:53.040
<b>I guess elves crave fried food when they catch a cold.</b>
